801	  <section class="entry" id="beyond">
802	    <span class="index-mark">09</span>
803	    <span class="tag">Beyond the Lab</span>
804	    <h2>Outside of Work</h2>
805	    <p>
806	      Outside of work, I try to do something I know I will regret later and still cannot wait to do. My
807	      favorite kind of day starts with a hike, a paraglide down, a swim in a nearby lake, a camp for the
808	      night, a game of chess, a little reading, some writing, and something simple cooked over a fire. It
809	      rarely goes as planned, and that is fine too, some of the best memories come from the parts that did
810	      not.
811	    </p>
812	    <p>
813	      I look for days like that on purpose, especially along the West Coast. Many of them came out of long
814	      road trips, which is how I ended up visiting over thirty states. Between trips I miss it more than I
815	      probably admit, until the next stretch of free time comes, and then I go do it all again.
816	    </p>
817	  </section>
